OL,3,GNEWSABush dog puppies emerge from their
OL,4,Aden to play
OL,5,
OL,6,FA litter of five bush dog puppies have
OL,7,Femerged from their den at their zoo
OL,8,Fhome after being born a month ago.
OL,10,FThe pups, the only litter born in the
OL,11,FUK this year, played with their parents
OL,12,Fand older siblings at Chester Zoo.
OL,14,FThey were born to four-year-old Molly
OL,15,Fafter a 65-day pregnancy. The pups are
OL,16,Fpart of a European conservation
OL,17,Fbreeding programme.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
